  VNmanager: {fileID: 1393436819}
  dialogue:
    name: 'HESTIA:'
    sentences:
    - You are amazing! But there is one more thing you must learn..
    - You see that platform that is above us?
    - Unfortunately you can not reach it at the moment.
    - However, if we had Charlotte here, we could travel up there to see if there
      are any more Michelin Stars there.
    - Which ties into our final lesson!
    - "You\u2019re going to need different characters to accomplish different things!"
