  VNmanager: {fileID: 1393436819}
  dialogue:
    name: 'HESTIA:'
    sentences:
    - Welcome to the Restaurant my worker from another world!
    - We have lots of work to do in order to get my restaurant  in top shape, but
      in order for that to happen, you need to be a highly skilled chef.
    - For now you are just a rookie, so the first thing we will do is start training
      in my garden.
    - Oh no! It appears we are being invaded from an enemy restaurant!
    - "You have to stop them! So quickly, use your \u201CA\u201D and \u201CD\u201D
      key to walk through the level and use your Spacebar to jump!"
