    name: 'HESTIA:'
    sentences:
    - "Wow look it\u2019s a Michelin Star!"
    - "I haven\u2019t seen one of those since I lost my restaurant!"
    - Each level has a set number of Michelin Stars.
    - 'Some are easy to get while others are more difficult. '
    - The more you collect, the greater the ranking our restaurant will be, so be
      sure to collect as many as you can.
